          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నేలమాళిగ — nēlamāḷiga — \"a basement; a cellar\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆ భవనం నేలమాళిగలో పార్కింగు ఉంది. ā bhavanaṁ nēlamāḷigalō pārkiṅgu undi. There is parking in the basement of that building."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నేల, the ground, + మాళిగ, a house: a room below the ground. Old palaces kept treasure in one."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నేలమాళిగ (nēlamāḷiga) is native Dravidian: నేల, \"the earth, the ground\" (DEDR 2913), and మాళిగ, \"a house, a storied house\" (DEDR 4796)."
            }
          ]
        },
